  75:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rcu.c ****     \brief      enable the peripherals clock
  76:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rcu.c ****     \param[in]  periph: RCU peripherals, refer to rcu_periph_enum
  77:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rcu.c ****                 only one parameter can be selected which is shown as below:
  78:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rcu.c ****       \arg        RCU_GPIOx (x=A,B,C,F): GPIO ports clock
  79:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rcu.c ****       \arg        RCU_DMA: DMA clock
