  85:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rcu.c ****       \arg        RCU_USARTx (x=0,1): USART clock
  86:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rcu.c ****       \arg        RCU_WWDGT: WWDGT clock
  87:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rcu.c ****       \arg        RCU_I2Cx (x=0,1): I2C clock
